## Resource Monitor Assignment

{%- set valid_orders = ['<domain>_<env>_<dataproduct>', '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>', '<env>_<domain>_<dataproduct>'] %}
{%- set order = object_component_order if object_component_order is defined and object_component_order in valid_orders else '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>' %}
{%- set strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
{%- set parts = [] %}
{%- for component in order.split('_') %}
{%- set token = component[1:-1] %}
{%- if token == 'domain' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Domain-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_domain | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'env' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Environment-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_environment | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'dataproduct' %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_name | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- set prefix = parts | join('_') %}

### Monitor Assignment Summary

| Warehouse | Resource Monitor |
|-----------|------------------|
{%- for wh in warehouse_configuration %}
| `{{ prefix }}_WH_{{ wh.name | upper }}` | `{{ prefix }}_MONITOR` |
{%- endfor %}

### Quota Distribution

**Shared Quota:** {{ resource_monitor_credits }} credits ({{ resource_monitor_frequency }})

All {{ warehouse_configuration | length }} warehouse(s) share this quota. Credit consumption is aggregated across all assigned warehouses.

### Credit Allocation

| Warehouse | Est. Credits/Hour | Recommended Max Usage |
|-----------|-------------------|----------------------|
{%- set credits_per_hour = {'X-SMALL': 1, 'SMALL': 2, 'MEDIUM': 4, 'LARGE': 8, 'X-LARGE': 16, '2X-LARGE': 32, '3X-LARGE': 64, '4X-LARGE': 128} %}
{%- for wh in warehouse_configuration %}
{%- set hourly = credits_per_hour.get(wh.size | upper, 1) * wh.max_cluster_count %}
| `{{ prefix }}_WH_{{ wh.name | upper }}` | {{ hourly }} | {{ (resource_monitor_credits / (warehouse_configuration | length)) | int }} |
{%- endfor %}

### After Assignment

Once assigned, the resource monitor will:
1. Track credit consumption from all assigned warehouses
2. Send notifications at 50%, 75%, and 90% thresholds
3. Suspend warehouses at 100% consumption
{%- set account_strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
